data.content:
Output matches what you need. The key piece is:

```csharp
var options = new JsonSerializerOptions
{
    PropertyNamingPolicy = JsonNamingPolicy.CamelCase
};
JsonSerializer.Serialize(person, options);
```

`JsonNamingPolicy.CamelCase` converts `Name` → `name` and `Age` → `age`. If you want camelCase globally without passing options each time, you can set `JsonSerializerOptions.Default` or use the `[JsonPropertyName]` attribute per-property.
